<title>USA: Versa Tech gets government contract.</title>
<headline>Versa Tech gets government contract.</headline>
<dateline>RACINE, Wis. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Versa Technologies Inc said Monday its industrial silicone division, Moxness Products Inc, was awarded a $250,000 contract by the Defense General Supply Center in Richmond, Va.</p>
<p>Terms provide for Moxness to supply three types of self-fusing rubber tape through September 19, 1997. The U.S. government has an option to extend terms of the contract for four additional one-year periods.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
